This module adapts deterministic patient-matching rule design and normalization
logic studied from:

    icanbwell/cms-hte-patient-matching
    https://github.com/icanbwell/cms-hte-patient-matching
    (CMS Patient Matching Proposal v3.4.0)

Upstream license: Apache License 2.0.

The rule table (rule ids, field combinations, P(collision) anchors), the
normalization vocabulary (CMS A-D), and the deterministic rule-ordering design
are adapted from that work. This implementation is an independent port in
pure Python + DuckDB with no dependency on the upstream package.
